# skillars-deferred-157 AC6: mark binary assets explicitly so no diff/merge/EOL handling ever
# touches them. Deliberately no `* text=auto` / `eol=` rule — that would renormalise every text file.
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
